0..71 Comment "//! Rules that overlap are admitted when their critical pairs join (the"
72..147 Comment "//! completion of [Knuth-1970-simple_word_problems_universal_algebras], and"
148..227 Comment "//! [Baader-1998-term_rewriting_and_all_that], § 6.2): zero a unit of addition"
228..304 Comment "//! on both sides overlaps the recursion on the first argument at `add(Zero,"
305..380 Comment "//! Zero)` and at `add(Succ(m), Zero)`, and both pairs rewrite to one term;"
381..443 Comment "//! associativity overlaps itself, and its one pair joins too."
