1708..1767 Comment "/// A semigroup\'s one law: associativity overlaps itself at"
1768..1841 Comment "/// `mul(mul(mul(a, b), c), d)`, and both ways round reach `mul(a, mul(b,"
1842..1916 Comment "/// mul(c, d)))`. The rewrite at the peak matches the rule\'s `z` against a"
1917..1980 Comment "/// subterm holding the peak\'s own `z`, which stays the peak\'s."
